    "function_v0": {
      "doc": "Receive protocol revenue, optionally tagged with a partner ID.\\n\\n# Arguments\\n* `sender`     \\xe2\\x80\\x94 the contract sending fees (engine, LP, etc.)\\n* `token`      \\xe2\\x80\\x94 the fee token address (usually USDC)\\n* `amount`     \\xe2\\x80\\x94 total fee amount in 7dp units\\n* `source`     \\xe2\\x80\\x94 fee type: \"stabfee\" | \"swapfee\" | \"liqfee\"\\n* `partner_id` \\xe2\\x80\\x94 optional partner referral tag; pass 0 for none.\\nWhen > 0, the partner's registered share is\\ndeducted before the protocol split.",
      "name": "receive_revenue",
      "inputs": [
